ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Verás, hace tiempo te pedí una
cosa{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} y luego me he dado cuenta
de que no me hacía falta.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Por eso prefería devolvértela
cuanto antes.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aquí la tienes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
y gracias de todas formas.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ich mach's kurz.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Du hast mir da doch neulich was
ausgeliehen. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Irgendwie weiß ich
nichts damit anzufangen.
Da, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}nimm's wieder mit,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}La cuestión es que me he
encontrado esto en el suelo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
delante de mi casa.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿No es tuyo?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey, thanks for the other day!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}You gave me a cup of water after
I'd just eaten something really
spicy, remember?
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}That glass of water saved my life!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You've got a quick wit there{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Let me give you some sort of
reward in return,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Te quería dar las gracias por
lo del otro día.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Te acuerdas?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Venía de comer guindillas picantes.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡El vaso de agua que me diste me
salvó el cuello!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Literalmente!
No sé cómo agradecértelo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tienes que darme alguna idea,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Merci pour l'autre fois !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Tu sais, quand tu m'as donné un
verre de lait alors que je venais de
manger un plat vraiment très épicé.
Tu m'as sauvé la vie !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Tu as réagi
si rapidement{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}J'aimerais te récompenser,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Grazie per avermi salvato l'altro
giorno!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Mi hai dato un bicchiere di
{{TAG:0005:000E:0000}} dopo che avevo
mangiato {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ricordi? Avevo un saporaccio
orribile in bocca, ma grazie
a te sono sopravvissuto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Cavoli, devo ricompensarti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Geçen gün için sağ ol!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Çok acı bir şey
yedikten sonra bana bir bardak su
vermiştin, hatırladın mı?
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}O su hayatımı kurtardı!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Aklın hızlı çalışıyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Karşılığında
sana bir ödül vereyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
